{"id":"n51055-8-5","stage":4,"title":"들먹이다 · 耸动","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51055-8-5-1","ko":"아기가 많이 컸네요.","zh":"宝宝长大了好多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컸네요.","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/55471587304b67b32498.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51055-8-5-2","ko":"네. 요즘 혼자 서보려고 엉덩이를 자주 들먹여요.","zh":"是啊，最近想自己站起来，总是翘起小屁股。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서보려고","meaning":"站，站立；试，试图","explanation":"서다：站，站立；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엉덩이를","meaning":"屁股，臀部","explanation":"엉덩이：屁股，臀部；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"엉덩이","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15128","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉덩이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들먹여요.","meaning":"耸动","explanation":"들먹이다：耸动；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들먹이다","audio":"/audio/e1964a4f38b7f9930215.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51055","senseId":"8","lemma":"들먹이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站，站立","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"人或动物把脚放在地上，使身体挺直。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"25d6d1ae86b669fa","term":"엉덩이","zh":"屁股，臀部","audio":"/audio/25d6d1ae86b669fab14a.mp3","entryId":"15128","definition":"指连接腰部与大腿的盆骨部分后方的浑圆部位。当坐下来时，其部位接触地面。","pronunciation":["엉ː덩이"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"e1964a4f38b7f993","term":"들먹이다","zh":"耸动","audio":"/audio/e1964a4f38b7f9930215.mp3","entryId":"51055","definition":"肩膀或臀部抬起放下；或指使其这样。","pronunciation":["들머기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d13e7148124e3839b257.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.215,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=51055","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"8","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.0417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，最近想自己站起来，总是翘起小屁股。","宝宝长大了好多。","我还以为我会考试不及格呢，没想到居然通过了，真幸运。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["宝宝长大了好多。","我还以为我会考试不及格呢，没想到居然通过了，真幸运。","是啊，最近想自己站起来，总是翘起小屁股。"],"answer":2}]}
